{"_id":"SoulBurnFeature1","name":"Soul Burn","type":"feat","img":"modules/soul-burn/icons/soul-burn.png","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You awaken the power of the Luminara and erupt in holy light, pushing beyond mortal limits. Spend one Hit Die to enter Soul Burn. While active, you gain double movement and one free Soul Burn action each turn.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"activate\"><i class=\"fas fa-fire\"></i> Enter Soul Burn</button></p><p><strong>This feature requires an available Hit Die.</strong></p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Soul Burn","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"spec"},"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"self"},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":"","actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"activate"}}}
{"_id":"AetherStrikeFeat","name":"AetherStrike","type":"feat","img":"modules/soul-burn/icons/aetherstrike.png","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per attack after you hit, burn your vitality to infuse the blow, spell, or projectile with Radiant energy. Spend and roll one Hit Die, then add the result to either the attack roll or the damage roll, but not both.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"strike\"><i class=\"fas fa-burst\"></i> Use AetherStrike</button></p><p>Hit Dice spent this way remain expended until recovered normally.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Soul Burn","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":"After an attack hits"},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"inst"},"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"spec"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":"","actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"requirements":"Active Soul Burn","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"strike"}}}
{"_id":"ChannelAetherFt1","name":"Channel Aether","type":"feat","img":"modules/soul-burn/icons/channel-aether.png","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Gather sacred energy and fire a brilliant beam of holy light at one enemy you can see. Make an attack roll. On a hit, the target takes Radiant damage equal to your Hit Die roll + your level. This does not consume a Hit Die.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"channel\"><i class=\"fas fa-sun\"></i> Channel Aether</button></p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Soul Burn","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"inst"},"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":60,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":1,"max":"1","per":"sr","recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":"","actionType":"rsak","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"requirements":"Active Soul Burn","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"channel"}}}
{"_id":"FateShiftFeature","name":"Fate Shift","type":"feat","img":"modules/soul-burn/icons/fate-shift.png","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Declare an action that bends, breaks, or modifies the normal rules of the game. The GM must approve it. This cannot manifest infinite resources or simply wish an enemy dead.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"fate\"><i class=\"fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles\"></i> Declare Fate Shift</button></p><p>Once the declaration is made, Soul Burn ends.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Soul Burn","activation":{"type":"legendary","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"inst"},"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":"self"},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":1,"max":"1","per":"charges","recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":"","actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"requirements":"Active Soul Burn","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"fate"}}}
{"_id":"AetherglowFeat01","name":"Aetherglow Charge","type":"consumable","img":"icons/consumables/potions/bottle-corked-labeled-blue.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A luminous charge of Aetherglow. Choose which player character receives it. If they have a Soul Burn tertiary resource, roll 1d20, subtract AG Tolerance, and remove that much Soul Burn (minimum 1). If they do not have a Soul Burn tertiary resource, the roll instead restores that many hit points. Their AG Tolerance then increases by 1, to a maximum of 19.</p><p><button type=\"button\" data-soul-burn-action=\"glow\"><i class=\"fas fa-flask\"></i> Give Aetherglow</button></p><p><em>AG Tolerance represents growing resistance to Aetherglow. It blocks Soul Burn release, while non-Soul-Burn recipients still receive the full healing roll.</em></p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Soul Burn","quantity":1,"weight":0,"price":{"value":0,"denomination":"gp"},"attunement":0,"equipped":false,"rarity":"","identified":true,"activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":null,"units":"inst"},"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"touch"},"uses":{"value":1,"max":"1","per":"charges","autoDestroy":false,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"charges","target":null,"amount":1},"consumableType":"potion","ability":"","actionType":"other","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"1d20","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"recharge":{"value":null,"charged":true}},"effects":[],"flags":{"soul-burn":{"action":"glow"}}}
